              "local_id": "root",
              "kind": "recipe",
              "field": "description",
              "region_id": null,
              "raw": "Take 3 of Butter, work it with your hands, till its no thicker then cream, y. put in y. yolks of 2. Eggs beat up by degrees, take of the white. Beat & work them in by degrees, take 3 of flower, & 3 of Sugar dryed & sifted & renewed in by degrees, & 3 Oz. of Carraway seeds, & a little sack cover y pan with a thin past & Butter it, y. it may slip out, you must keep it stirring till its in the Oven, which must be very hot.",
